<section class="section surface-page clip-x" id="detail" style="padding-top:clamp(40px,6vw,80px)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="svc-detail reveal assemble" data-assemble>
      <div class="sd-left">
        <div class="sd-num" aria-hidden="true" data-n="03"></div>
        <span class="tag">Diagnosis</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sd-body">
        <p>We take a close look at how your operation runs: where time goes, where work waits and where effort is repeated. You get a clear picture of the biggest gaps and a practical plan to close them, whether the fix is AI, automation or a change in process.</p>
        <ul class="deliverables asm-stage">
          <li class="asm-card">Operations review &amp; interviews</li>
          <li class="asm-card">Process &amp; handoff mapping</li>
          <li class="asm-card">Bottleneck &amp; rework analysis</li>
          <li class="asm-card">Prioritized list of fixes</li>
          <li class="asm-card">Implementation roadmap</li>
          <li class="asm-card">Measures to track progress</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

